1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,994
Margaret Wilson is selling the company she built.

2
00:00:03,034 --> 00:00:07,016
For her family, it raises one question: what's fair?

3
00:00:07,507 --> 00:00:13,008
By 2048, 124 trillion dollars will change hands in the U.S.

4
00:00:13,048 --> 00:00:16,142
And heirs often leave the family's advisor.

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:20,551
Family Table sits between the family and their PNC advisor,

6
00:00:20,591 --> 00:00:26,497
Alex Lee: a consent-based AI layer that guides them through three steps.

7
00:00:26,537 --> 00:00:28,300
Align. Allocate. Activate.

8
00:00:29,043 --> 00:00:31,519
It starts with a signal PNC already holds:

9
00:00:31,559 --> 00:00:35,369
account activity that says a sale is likely, a year early.

10
00:00:35,409 --> 00:00:38,515
Alex reviews it, then calls Margaret.

11
00:00:38,970 --> 00:00:40,930
Margaret adds her documents.

12
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,427
AI reads them and drafts her goals.

13
00:00:43,467 --> 00:00:47,368
She checks each one, and invites her family.

14
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:50,888
Each family member checks in privately.

15
00:00:50,928 --> 00:00:53,728
Claire says what she's never told her mother.

16
00:00:53,768 --> 00:00:55,553
Her words stay hers.

17
00:00:55,593 --> 00:00:59,902
AI lifts out the themes, and she decides what Alex sees.

18
00:01:00,273 --> 00:01:01,684
On Alex's side,

19
00:01:01,724 --> 00:01:06,482
AI turns four check-ins and three family documents into one brief.

20
00:01:06,522 --> 00:01:09,027
The widest gap is fairness.

21
00:01:09,067 --> 00:01:12,000
AI prepares; Alex makes the call.

22
00:01:12,902 --> 00:01:14,344
Then, Allocate.

23
00:01:14,384 --> 00:01:18,615
Sam sees his own number under every split and votes in private.

24
00:01:18,655 --> 00:01:22,512
Three choices turn twelve possible plans into one.

25
00:01:22,668 --> 00:01:26,174
Then, Activate. Sam asks a question.

26
00:01:26,214 --> 00:01:29,603
AI drafts the answer from PNC's calculators;

27
00:01:29,643 --> 00:01:31,785
Alex checks it and sends it.

28
00:01:31,825 --> 00:01:36,091
Nothing reaches the family until the advisor approves.

29
00:01:36,259 --> 00:01:38,648
One year on, the sale has closed,

30
00:01:38,688 --> 00:01:40,554
the plan is everyday banking,

31
00:01:40,594 --> 00:01:43,307
and all five Wilsons work with PNC.

32
00:01:43,747 --> 00:01:48,121
Why only PNC? Three proprietary assets in one consented stack:

33
00:01:48,161 --> 00:01:50,748
a signal PNC already holds,

34
00:01:50,788 --> 00:01:53,483
family intelligence that's private by default,

35
00:01:53,523 --> 00:01:55,457
and one household graph.

36
00:01:55,938 --> 00:01:58,831
Family Table. A plan the family trusts.
